title: "Drug repurposing on the Hetionet knowledge graph with relational graph convolutional networks"
abstract: "Prediction of drug–disease treatment relationships in the Hetionet biomedical knowledge graph using a relational graph convolutional network (R-GCN), evaluated on held-out links against a common-neighbour baseline."
